---
description: Prepare one rebuildRunOfShow evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: EventRecoveryOption[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Use exact scheduling and resource checks to construct a revised run of show with owners, dependencies, and decision deadlines. Reserve resources before announcing changes, preserve crew readiness, and identify points beyond which a contingency is no longer feasible. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
